<title>USA: Oak Tree Medical to buy therapy centers.</title>
<headline>Oak Tree Medical to buy therapy centers.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oak Tree Medical Systems Inc said on Wednesday it has agreed to acquire Parkside Physical Therapy Services PC, Physical Therapy &amp; Sports Rehabilitation Inc; and Orthopedic and Sports Therapy LP.</p>
<p>The facilities are all based in New York.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the centers, plus a contemplated aquatic therapy facility in New York, will boost 1996 revenues by an additional $5 million.</p>
<p>Purchase prices were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
